<title>USA: Texfi stake lifted by Chadbourne group.</title>
<headline>Texfi stake lifted by Chadbourne group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Chadbourne Corp said on Friday it raised its stake in Texfi Industries Inc to 22.6 percent or 1,977,700 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 267,400 additional shares of Texfi between August 23 and October 2 at prices ranging from $2.375 to $3.00 a share.</p>
</text>
